  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen genomf&#xF6;rs av Sipu International. Federala myndigheter har i allt st&#xF6;rre utstr&#xE4;ckning visat intresse f&#xF6;r det svenska samarbetet inom sociala sektorn. I studiebes&#xF6;ket ing&#xE5;r svensk barnomsorg samt att tr&#xE4;ffa vissa svenska parter som samarbetar med Ryssland.B&#xF6;r resulterara i framtida federala insatser - samt policy arbete med V&#xE4;rldsbanken - som &#xE4;ven deltar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish partner: Sipu International. Federal authorities have shown an increased interest in the Swedish methods within the social sector. The study visit includes Swedish Child Welfare and meeting Swedish partners which cooperate with Russia. Should result in future federal projects - includig policy work with the WB which participate in the visit.</narrative>
  </description>
